            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batengwana abacete balayandaula maanzi pele taakwe, aboobo indimi zyabo zyayuminina nkaambo kanyota. Mebo nde-Jehova njoobavwiila, mebo nde-Leza wa-Israyeli nsikooyoobalekelezya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.35.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 35:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.35.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.107.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Int 107:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njootuntumusya milonga atala lyazilundu zikukwidwe muuwo, amwalo mumakuti njoobusya matoolo. Njoosandula inkanda kuba iziba lyamaanzi, ayalo nyika injumu iyooba tusensa twamaanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumonya munkanda njoomeneka misamu yakedari ayamuunga ayamisiwe ayamafuta, amugundu muyoomena misamu yakupresi amisigili amizimbwa yoonse antoomwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
